---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Software Decision Guide">
  <main class="site-container py-32">
    <h1 class="mb-6 max-w-3xl text-5xl font-brand text-primary">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>

    <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">
      <p>
        Software Decision Guide may collect basic information that users voluntarily provide, such as an email address submitted to receive a recommendation or follow-up content.
      </p>

      <p>
        The site may also use analytics tools to understand page visits, guide starts, guide completions, and outbound clicks. This helps improve the decision guides and site experience.
      </p>

      <p>
        If affiliate links are used, third-party software providers or affiliate networks may use cookies or tracking technologies to attribute referrals.
      </p>

      <p>
        Users can contact Software Decision Guide with privacy questions at the contact email listed on the Contact page.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>